  "title": "Vegetarian &#34;Beetloaf&#34;",
  "description": "Follow this simple &#34;beetloaf&#34; recipe for a delicious, vegetarian &#34;meatloaf&#34;-version, or switch up the veggies, nuts, and seasonings to make the loaf your own.",
